            </h1>

            <div class="space-x-8 font-medium">
                <a href="index.html" class="text-emerald-700">Beranda</a>
                <a href="kajian.html" class="hover:text-emerald-700">Kajian</a>
                <a href="tentang.html" class="hover:text-emerald-700">Tentang</a>
